  "term": "cycle",
  "definition": "In learning, a cycle is a repeating sequence of phases through which experience is turned into learning. In the Kolb learning cycle described here, this process moves through experimentation, concretization, observation, and conceptualization, and can be shaped not only by an individual’s activity but also by group interaction.",
